## Frequently asked questions

**Do you only work with Merthyr Tydfil businesses?**

No. While we're based in Merthyr Tydfil, we work with businesses across South Wales and the UK. But we're especially well-placed to help local businesses compete in the Merthyr and Valleys market.

**How much does a website cost?**

One-page WordPress websites start from £199. Larger custom small business websites are quoted based on the number of pages and features required. We offer fixed-price packages with no hidden costs — [get in touch](/contact/) for a free quote.

**Can you help improve my Google rankings?**

Yes. Every website we build is SEO-ready from day one. We also offer dedicated [local SEO campaigns](/services/local-seo-google-ranking/) for businesses that want to go further.

**How long does a website take?**

Most projects are completed within 7–14 days depending on scope and how quickly we receive content from you.

**Will my website work on mobile?**

Yes. Every website we build uses mobile-first design — it will look and perform perfectly on phones, tablets, and desktops.

**Can I update the site myself?**

Yes. We build on platforms that give you full access to manage your own content, and we provide training as part of every project.

**Do you build ecommerce websites in Merthyr Tydfil?**

Yes — if you want to sell products or services online, we build custom ecommerce stores using Shopify, WooCommerce, and SureCart. See our [ecommerce web design Merthyr Tydfil](/ecommerce-web-design-merthyr-tydfil/) page for more details.

We also offer web development for Merthyr Tydfil businesses if you need the full build handled alongside your design.

We also offer a [managed starter website for Merthyr Tydfil businesses](/managed-starter-websites-merthyr-tydfil/) — a fully managed package from £20/month inc. VAT with no upfront costs.

